    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 154 of the laws of 1921 relating to the port authority of New York and New Jersey, in relation to port authority organization, open meetings, public hearings, financial reporting and handling of property",
    "basePrintNo": "S5998",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5998-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
